    "known_reader_boundaries": [
      "litchi-pptx::Package::fonts reads the presentation embeddedFontLst, validates the font relationship and application/x-fontdata content type, and returns the Cambria Math EOT payload; it does not interpret or rasterize the font program.",
      "litchi-pptx::Slide text access exposes the equation placeholder's non-breaking-space fallback text, while the slide XML retains the native OMML tree under a14:m and the MCE fallback picture. Raw OMML is therefore the authoritative semantic fixture evidence for these equations.",
      "litchi-pptx::presentation_properties::math parses presentation-level a14:m math properties in presProps.xml. This deck has slide-level OMML but no presentation-level math extension, so math_properties() returns None.",
      "litchi-pptx::presentation_properties::metadata::handout::Master parses p:hf metadata and the handout background color. PowerPoint stored these native handout labels as direct hdr/ftr/sldNum placeholders instead of p:hf, so the typed parser reports default header/footer/date/page flags even though the raw handout master contains the markers and slide-number field.",
      "litchi-ppt::Presentation::fonts reads the legacy FontCollection and PP10 embedding flags, but the legacy derivative has no embedded font data and reports has_embedded_fonts=false.",
      "litchi-ppt::Presentation slide shape text reads the four legacy titles and slide-one body text; it does not expose the native equation semantics, handout placeholder text, or equation fallback pictures through the typed shape model.",
      "The native print selection was canceled: PPTX presProps.xml has no p:prnPr and the legacy Document stream has no PrintOptionsAtom (record type 0x1770), so no persisted print-layout assertion is made."
    ]
  },
